#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:5
#: 4b91bac7d90844c79dc77d8dbe999f1f
msgid "Preparing for Tuning"
msgstr "调参前的准备工作"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:7
#: 0484470670b54b1ba1340d4f9464dfb7
msgid ""
"It is important to conduct the steps in this wiki to prepare for manual or "
"autotune.  The following video covers the steps described on this wiki page."
msgstr "按照本 wiki 中的步骤为手动调参或 AutoTune 做好准备非常重要。以下视频涵盖了本 wiki 页面中描述的步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:12
#: 45fce0bceac84d05a3840a10d198aa53
msgid "Reduce Noisy Control Signals"
msgstr "减少嘈杂的控制信号"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:14
#: fbd3ef59c0cc4b9eb23a0d7e512ffcec
msgid ""
"Prior to starting to manually tune or AutoTune, make sure that the noise in "
"the control signals is reduced as low as possible.  The best way to do this "
"is to use the harmonic notch filter.  Follow the instructions in "
":ref:`Helicopter Dynamic Notch Filter Setup<common-imu-notch-filtering-"
"helicopter-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"在开始手动调参或 AutoTune 之前，请确保控制信号中的噪声尽可能降低。最佳方法是使用谐波陷波滤波器。请按照 :ref:`Helicopter "
"Dynamic Notch Filter Setup<common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup>` "
"中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:16
#: cc98cc686fa643b39e1f5f2918122b75
msgid ""
"A good way to check the control signals is to set the LOG_BITMASK parameter "
"so that the FAST ATTITUDE and PID messages are selected in addition to the "
"default selections.  Use a GCS software like Mission Planner to view the "
"PIDR.Act, PIDP.Act, and PIDY.Act.  The noise in these signals should be low."
"  The example below shows the target roll rate (red) and actual roll rate "
"(green).  The rates are given in rad/s.  Note the vibration (noise) in the "
"actual roll rate with peaks reaching 0.2 to -0.2 rad/s. This would be a lot "
"of noise and could cause the autotune to fail or cause a poor tune.  "
"Ultimately, the deviation in the actual rates should be small (< 0.05 "
"rad/s)."
msgstr ""
"检查控制信号的一个好方法是设置 LOG_BITMASK 参数，使 FAST ATTITUDE 和 PID 消息在默认选项之外也被选中。使用 "
"Mission Planner 等 GCS 软件查看 PIDR.Act、PIDP.Act 和 "
"PIDY.Act。这些信号中的噪声应该较低。下面的示例显示了目标横滚角速率（红色）和实际横滚角速率（绿色），单位为 "
"rad/s。请注意实际横滚角速率中的震动（噪声），峰值达到 0.2 至 -0.2 rad/s。这会产生大量噪声，可能导致 AutoTune "
"失败或调参效果不佳。最终，实际角速率的偏差应较小（< 0.05 rad/s）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:20
#: e755a7fe73c94e4cb6ca3c7e06c466cb
msgid ""
"Before tuning, it is recommended to check that high frequency vibrations are"
" not causing the \"leans\" (see :ref:`traditional-helicopter-tips`)"
msgstr "在调参之前，建议检查高频震动是否会导致\"倾斜\"（参见 :ref:`traditional-helicopter-tips`）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:23
#: 8fd283c9e8be4cf1bce5441223dc1c4d
msgid "Ensure Helicopter does not drift in a Hover"
msgstr "确保直升机在悬停时不漂移"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning-preparing.rst:25
#: 54f94307bc8745ab8f142394dcb7ce65
msgid ""
"Follow the procedures in the Hover Trim section of the :ref:`First Flight "
"Tests<traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests>` wiki page to ensure the "
"heli maintains a near driftless hover (< 1 m/s)."
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`First Flight Tests<traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests>` "
"wiki 页面中悬停配平部分的程序，确保直升机保持接近零漂移的悬停（< 1 m/s）。"

